pocketchip-configs (0.7) trixie; urgency=low

  * skel: make the awesome theme path + the GTK2 ".mine" include home-agnostic
    ($HOME / a relative include instead of a hardcoded /home/chip) so the
    /etc/skel copies work for any user account, not just one named "chip".
  * skel/.gtkrc-2.0: use the stock Adwaita GTK + icon theme instead of the
    custom "Chip" theme / "Faenza-Dark" icons, dropping the chip-theme and
    faenza-icon-theme dependencies; small-screen widget/font tweaks kept.

